Update 1.04 includes the following new features and bug fixes:

[list]
[*]Fixed bug where it would sometimes not stop raining.
[*]The castle can now be selected using "F1". 
[*]Fixed bug where spiders and the undead would not attack the red team.
[*]The AI will only begin attacking your base on easy if you damage one of their buildings. (does not include spiders and the undead).
[*]Graphical fix - Resources and health bar sprites will no longer remain bright at night time;
[*]Improved diplomacy - There is now more chance that the AI will reject an alliance, also they will continue to refuse no matter how many times you request it.
[*]Dragon's take half damage from fire spells;
[*]Ice wizard's take half damage from ice spells;
[*]Fire wizard's take half damage from fire spells;
[*]Storm wizard's take half damage from lightning spells;
[*]The group window will now collapse when not in use;
[*]Fixed bug where background was not loaded in missions (bug was introduced in update 1.03).
[*]Fixed bug where AI gates were not being destroyed.
[/list]

