Update 1.06 is now live, new features and bug fixes include:

[list]
[*]New 'rain' weather effect;
[*]Traps have now been added to the map editor;
[*]Ice and Necro towers have now been added to the map editor;
[*]Auto save has now been added to mission mode. The auto save feature is a  single save file which will be overwritten every 10 minutes.
[*]New 'Golden Chests' - Golden chests contain more resources than standard 
chests.
[*]Added option to unlock any mission allowing players who may have lost mission progress to recover it, this option will be removed when WizardCraft leaves Early Access.
[*]General bug fixes and improved performance;
[/list]

